        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A WONDERFUL 2 BED 2 BATH FIRST FLOOR APARTMENT WITH PRIVATE BALCONY AND UNDERGROUND CAR SPACE IDEALLY SITUATED WITHIN MINUTES WALK TO COOLMINE TRAIN STATION IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER ROSEHAVEN APARTMENT COMPLEX IN CASTLEKNOCK DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY ADVISED.... \r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Castleknock Property Specialists are delighted to present No.15 Rosehaven to the Dublin 15 property market. Rosehaven is a popular private very well maintained development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA simply superb investment by any standards this apartment will make a fine modern home. No. 15 will appeal to first time buyers downsizers and investors alike. This excellent property has been tastefully decorated and is in immaculate walk in condition. This beautiful apartment features top quality flooring fixtures and fittings. *To include all brand new appliances namely oven/hob microwave dishwasher fridge freezer and washer/dryer. *Also this apartment is fitted with brand new items of furniture all of which are fully included in the sale. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living / dining plus kitchen area. There are two bedrooms to include primary en-suite, a family bathroom and hot press. \r\n\r\nThe hall door of this beautiful charming family home opens to an entrance hall leading to the living / dining / kitchen area which is flooded with natural light. The top grade designer kitchen has an abundance of worktop space and storage space. Both bedrooms are generous doubles each fitted with wardrobe space. The master bedroom features a private en-suite bathroom. The family bathroom is fully tiled and boasts top quality sanitary ware. \r\n\r\nThe property boasts top grade double glazing and a central heating system. The attractive balcony view overlooks a green. A car space in the underground carpark is included in the sale. \r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned literally two minutes walk from the Coolmine train station which offers easy access to both Luas and dart services. Dublin City Centre is only a short commute. The location is second to none within only a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. The villages of Blanchardstown is located within easy walking distance. The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and all its amenities is literally on your doorstep. D. 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The gorgeous Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village itself are within a 10 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. The area is further serviced by an excellent bus route. The M50 / M3 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\n***Mangement Fee circa €2500 per annum including bins***\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
